<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras BR Jan net $13.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras BR Jan net $13.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil products distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of federal oil monopoly Petrobras, released the following January net profit.</p>
<p>			 Jan 1997		    Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Net		 $13.3 million		   $13.5 million</p>
<p>    Gross Sales    $773.8 million		  $676.5 million</p>
<p>Note: All figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
